# Real secrets — .env.example stays tracked as the template, but the
# actual .env (currently holds a live Groq key) should never be committed.
# Found untracked-by-gitignore during the 2026-09-14 review; see README
# §16/§17 — if this file is already in git history, rotate the key too,
# since removing it from .gitignore alone doesn't scrub past commits.
.env

